{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"You have upheld your duty and shown true faith with each peril you face. You have sacrificed yourself in a way that means you continue your service to good. You have acted with a level head, letting your emotions guide your morals, but your decision making to be unhindered and true.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:18:17.501000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745013656948834478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Traditionally after my term is to expire it would move to a vote unless the order has more than 12 Knights. Once Florian Chadpelle becomes a full knight, we would be at 12. For this, I name you my 2nd. If I am to expire prematurely, or have my term come to an end in 12 years, **you** will be the next Eclipse Knight. \"\n\nHe smiles warmly. His excitement bubbles\n\nHe taps each of your shoulders once more\n\n\" Rise Lady Lilia, the Devoted\"\n\"Devoted to good, your faith, and to the aid of others.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:21:07.584000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745014370328641646","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
